``` CL-05 | Maintenance Mode Audit: Who, When, Still On?
    Splunk Administrator Field Manual - Gaurav Malik

    Use case: Audit who enabled cluster maintenance mode, when it was set, and
    whether it was left on after the change window closed.
    Run on: SH for the history, CM for the current state.
    Query: Current state (CM)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/CL-05-probe.spl,
    probes/CL-05-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
    STATUS: lab verification pending; field or message names may differ on your version.
```
| rest splunk_server=local /services/cluster/master/info
| table label maintenance_mode rolling_restart_flag
